{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture, fine-tune, and perfect your palette. This desktop tool instantly extracts any color from your screen with pixel-perfect precision, giving you the exact codes you need to perfect your creative workflow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel-Perfect Precision</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract the perfect color from any pixel on your screen or multi-monitor setup. Color Picker ensures you get the exact tone you see, eliminating guesswork from your workflow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant Color Codes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Copy HEX, RGB, and HSL codes directly to your clipboard with a single click. Color Picker provides the exact data you need, instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and Organize</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color Picker automatically saves your last 11 colors. Plus, you can play with shades, complementary colors, and use the integrated canvas to effortlessly select new hues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable for Your Workflow</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark and light mode options to match your workspace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the app's language in the settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own custom keyboard shortcut.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><i>With Color Picker, your screen becomes your canvas.</i></strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Cyan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3914380/d2ba2dd708f93f21fd16bb2a5ee20a0b8f1e06a1.jpg"},{"name":"Magenta","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3914380/37eeb273edc17f328f0d03fec66980395a242b5b.jpg"},{"name":"